msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti rẹ (tí ó bá ṣófo, yóò lo &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Standard Error Log Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Àkọsílẹ̀ Àṣìṣe Déédéé ti Olùkójọpọ̀"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with Cacti's Data Collectors, set this file path and the Data Collectors standard error will be redirected to this file"
msgstr "Tí o bá ń ní ìṣòro pẹ̀lú Àwọn Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà Cacti, ṣètò ọ̀nà fáìlì yìí, a ó sì darí àṣìṣe déédéé ti Àwọn Olùkójọpọ̀ Dátà sí fáìlì yìí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìwádìí Àṣìṣe Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Log file where Boost will write its information to.  It much be located in the same directory as the Cacti Log file."
msgstr "Èyí ni fáìlì Àkọsílẹ̀ tí Boost yóò kọ ìfitónilétí rẹ̀ sí. Ó gbọ́dọ̀ wà nínú àpò-ìwé kan náà pẹ̀lú fáìlì Àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alternate Poller Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Olùkójọpọ̀ Mìíràn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spine Binary File Location"
msgstr "Ibùdó Fáìlì Bínárì Spine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì bínárì Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spine Config File Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Fáìlì Ìṣètò Spine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /etc if not specified."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì ìṣètò Spine. Ní àìyípadà, ó wà nínú cwd ti Spine, tàbí /etc bí a kò bá tọ́ka sí i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean"
msgstr "Ìfọ̀mọ́ Àdáṣe RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automatically archive or delete RRDfiles when their corresponding Data Sources are removed from Cacti"
msgstr "Fi àwọn RRDfile pamọ́ tàbí pa wọ́n rẹ́ láìfọwọ́yí nígbà tí a bá yọ àwọn Orísun Dátà wọn kúrò nínú Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean Method"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Ìfọ̀mọ́ Àdáṣe RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Cacti after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà tí a ń lò láti fọ àwọn RRDfile kúrò nínú Cacti lẹ́yìn tí a bá pa àwọn Orísun Dátà wọn rẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Archive directory"
msgstr "Fóldà ìpamọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr "Èyí ni fóldà ibi tí a ti <strong>gbé</strong> àwọn RRDfile lọ fún ìpamọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Àkọsílẹ̀"

#: include/global_settings.php
