msgstr "Ìwọ̀n fọ́ntì tí a lò fún Àwọn Ẹyọ-ìwọ̀n Àwòrán"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Unit Font Setting"
msgstr "Ètò Fọ́ntì Ẹyọ-ìwọ̀n"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Unit items.  Enter either a valid True Type Font file or valid Pango font-config value."
msgstr "Fọ́ntì láti lò fún àwọn ohun Ẹyọ-ìwọ̀n Àwòrán.  Tẹ fáìlì True Type Font tó tọ́ tàbí iye Pango font-config tó tọ́ sílẹ̀."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Ìkójọpọ̀ Dátà Ti Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Tí o bá fẹ́ dá ìlànà ìṣèwádìí dúró pátápátá, yọ àmì kúrò nínú àpótí yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Irú Olùṣèwádìí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Irú olùṣèwádìí láti lò.  Ètò yìí yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́ ní àlàfo ìṣèwádìí tó kàn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Àlàfo ìṣèwádìí tí à ń lò.  Ètò yìí yóò nípa lórí bí a ṣe ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn fáìlì RRDfiles tó.  <strong><u>ÀKÍYÈSÍ: Tí o bá yí iye yìí padà, o gbọ́dọ̀ tún àkójọ ìpamọ́ olùṣèwádìí kún.  Àìṣe bẹ́ẹ̀ lè yọrí sí pípàdánù dátà.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "kì í ṣe àṣàyàn tó tọ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ìgbàgbogbo tí olùkójọ dátà Cacti yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀.  O lè lo crontab, iṣẹ́ tí a ṣètò (fún windows), tàbí iṣẹ́ systemd cactid láti ṣàkóso bíbẹ̀rẹ̀ olùkójọ dátà Cacti.  Fún àwọn ìtọ́ni lórí lílo daemon cactid, ṣàgbéyẹ̀wò fáìlì README.md nínú fódà iṣẹ́."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Ṣe Ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì Ẹrù Iṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Tí o bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò gbìyànjú láti ṣe ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì ẹrù iṣẹ́ olùṣèwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan nípa pípín àwọn ohun olùṣèwádìí déédéé fún iṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ìbú Àbájáde Àtúnṣe-àṣìṣe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Tí o bá yan àṣàyàn yìí, Cacti yóò ṣàyẹ̀wò fún àbájáde tó kọjá agbára Cacti láti fi pamọ́, yóò sì fúnni ní ìkìlọ̀ nígbà tí ó bá rí i."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìparí Aṣojú Òkèèrè"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Sọ Tábìlì Olùṣèwádìí Dọ̀tun Ní Ìyípo Kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ètò yìí wà fún àwọn ètò olùṣèwádìí kan ṣoṣo nìkan láti tún tábìlì àbájáde olùṣèwádìí kọ́ ní ìyípo ìṣèwádìí kọ̀ọ̀kan láti dènà kí tábìlì ìrántí má baà ṣe pàṣípààrọ̀ (swap) lórí àwọn ètò ńlá pẹ̀lú àwọn ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà ńlá tí ó lè lo swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Ìṣàtúnṣe-ẹ̀dà Olùkójọ Dátà"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Ìṣàṣọ̀kan Olùṣèwádìí"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Àlàfo ìṣàṣọ̀kan ìṣèwádìí àìyípadà láti lò nígbà tí a bá ń ṣẹ̀dá olùṣèwádìí kan.  Ètò yìí yóò nípa lórí bí a ṣe ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àti ṣàtúnṣe àwọn olùṣèwádìí òkèèrè tó."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Pa Ìṣàtúnṣe-ẹ̀dà Àkójọ Ìpamọ́ Ohun-èlò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ àìṣàtúnṣe, Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Cacti pàtàkì yóò fi gbogbo ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù àti àwọn àfikún pamọ́ sínú Àkójọpọ̀ Ohun Èlò (Resource Cache). Lẹ́yìn náà, lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Látòkèèrè yóò máa ṣe àtúnṣe ara wọn pẹ̀lú èyíkéyìí àtúnṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Cacti pàtàkì. Àkójọpọ̀ Ohun Èlò yìí ń jẹ́ kí àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Látòkèèrè lè ṣe àgbéga fúnra wọn. Tí o kò bá fẹ́ lo àṣàyàn yìí, o lè pa á nípa lílo ètò yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Pa Ìṣọ̀kan Kíkún Aládàáṣe nígbà Àgbéga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ àìṣàtúnṣe, nígbà tí a bá ń ṣe àgbéga ètò Cacti Pàtàkì, yóò ṣe Ìṣọ̀kan Kíkún sí gbogbo àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà. Ìlànà yìí lè gba àkókò púpọ̀. Nítorí náà, láti jẹ́ kí àwọn àgbéga parí kíákíá, a pèsè àṣàyàn yìí. Kíyèsí i pé tí a bá pa èyí, olùṣàkóso Cacti gbọ́dọ̀ fi ipá ṣe ìlànà yìí láti ojú-ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ Àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà lẹ́yìn àgbéga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Akójọpọ̀ Dátà Àfikún"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ìkọsílẹ̀ Dátà Tí Kò Tọ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Báwo ni o ṣe fẹ́ kí a kọ àwọn àṣìṣe àbájáde Akójọpọ̀ Dátà sílẹ̀? Àwọn àṣàyàn pẹ̀lú: 'Àlàyé Kíkún' tí ó ń ṣàlàyé gbogbo àṣìṣe, 'Àkótán' tí ó ń pèsè iye àwọn àṣìṣe àbájáde fún Ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àti 'Kò sí', tí kì í pèsè ìṣirò àṣìṣe."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Àkótán"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Àlàyé Kíkún"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Iye Àwọn Olùpèsè Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ìlànà olùpèsè àkọsílẹ̀ ètò tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà fún ìlànà spine kọ̀ọ̀kan. Àwọn ètò láàárín 1 sí 15 ni a gbà. Ìlànà yìí yóò ṣèrànwọ́ tí o bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ àti àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ètò olùpèsè, ó sì wúlò fún Akójọpọ̀ Dátà spine nìkan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Iye Àkókò Ìdádúró Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò àti Olùpèsè Àkọsílẹ̀ Ètò"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Àkókò tí ó pọ̀ jùlọ tí spine yóò fi dúró de àkọsílẹ̀ ètò láti parí. Iye àkókò ìdádúró yìí wà ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá ó sì wúlò fún àwọn Akójọpọ̀ Dátà cmd.php àti spine méjèèjì."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Ìdènà Àtúnsọ Àbájáde Olùṣàyẹ̀wò Kò Ṣófo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Tí o bá ń ní ìṣòro pẹ̀lú àwọn orísun dátà kan, ìkìlọ̀ 'Poller Output Not Empty' lè kún inú Ìméèlì rẹ. Tí èyí bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀, o lè dín ìkìlọ̀ ètò náà kù ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú àkókò àárín yìí."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka Gbogbo Ẹ̀rọ Lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Ètò Àkókò Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka Gbogbo Ẹ̀rọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Báwo ni o ṣe fẹ́ kí a máa ṣe Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka gbogbo àwọn Ẹ̀rọ léraléra tó. Àtúnṣe Àtọ́ka yìí yóò wáyé ní ọ̀gànjọ́ òru ní ìgbà tí o bá yan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Lọ́sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ ní Ọjọ́ Àìkú"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Lóṣooṣù ní Ọjọ́ Àìkú"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Runtime Variation/Deviance Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Ìyàtọ̀/Ìyapa Àkókò Ìṣiṣẹ́"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Count Warning Threshold"
msgstr "Ààlà Ìkìlọ̀ Iye Wákàtí Kan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
